[7846]={["aftermath"]="The elder declared himself free and promised that Revantusk would know of the deed.",["atomIDs"]={"7846:description:1-54","7846:description:56-81","7846:description:83-122","7846:description:127-180","7846:description:182-221","7846:objective:1-107","7846:objective:109-165"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7846:completion:1-16","7846:completion:18-31","7846:completion:33-63"},["opening"]="The elder's bindings could not be removed without Hitah'ya's key. The well-guarded keeper waited in a nearby cave, standing between captivity and the promised return home.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the shackle key.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the key to Elder Torntusk.",["sourceHash"]="16b8ace9578de359100dc3e617b27850ad0866682c16be5ed5551708d7f5846e",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7847]={["aftermath"]="Primal acknowledged the service to the Revantusk and their gratitude.",["atomIDs"]={"7847:description:1-56","7847:description:58-88","7847:description:90-115","7847:objective:1-114"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7847:completion:1-48","7847:completion:50-86"},["opening"]="The freed elder sent news ahead to his mate. His message promised that he was coming home, leaving the village to receive word before his arrival.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to tell Primal of the rescue.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the elder's message.",["sourceHash"]="80fee43ec1eef261df3fada27c093cff3317b0e0af38f69ffb689cf6890dcfff",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7848]={["aftermath"]="Lothos declared that he could now transport the attuned traveler to the Molten Core.",["atomIDs"]={"7848:description:1-49","7848:description:51-172","7848:description:177-186","7848:description:188-194","7848:description:196-273","7848:description:278-334","7848:description:339-364","7848:description:366-386","7848:description:388-446","7848:description:448-511","7848:objective:1-88","7848:objective:90-180"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"7848:completion:1-50","7848:completion:52-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover a core fragment at the Molten Core portal and return to Lothos.",["opening"]="Lothos sensed a rift through Blackrock Mountain to the Firelord's domain that others could not readily perceive. A fragment from the entry portal would let him attune another traveler to that hidden passage.",["pending"]="{actor} would retrieve the core fragment for Lothos.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the core fragment to Lothos.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="55bf4662ffa66b3e3938b70becac2831727cc03c9000b9c3044adc7619f92edb",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[7849]={["aftermath"]="Markhor mourned his brother and thanked the person who brought him home.",["atomIDs"]={"7849:description:1-67","7849:description:69-167","7849:description:172-302","7849:description:307-372","7849:description:374-397","7849:objective:1-105","7849:objective:107-196","7849:objective:201-296","7849:objective:298-397","7849:objective:399-450"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7849:completion:1-42","7849:completion:47-80","7849:completion:82-113"},["opening"]="Markhor's twin had been taken in the same raid but executed rather than held for sacrifice. His remains were given to the Vilebranch's oozes and wolves, and recovery was now a matter of his soul.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Malkhor's skull and bones.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the remains to Markhor.",["sourceHash"]="4a4ab15c5a3cd48508cee77143147bf724b95703762d471b8ebdd8f230e105be",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7850]={["aftermath"]="Primal said the compulsion had lifted for now and warned that another priestess could replace a fallen one.",["atomIDs"]={"7850:description:1-48","7850:description:50-117","7850:description:122-188","7850:description:190-310","7850:description:315-435","7850:objective:1-122","7850:objective:124-176"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7850:completion:1-70","7850:completion:72-201"},["opening"]="Primal attributed Vilebranch ferocity and madness to Hexx's vessels of tainted blood. Removing them would let her cleanse the magic feeding Hakkar's influence.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover ten blood vessels.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the vessels to Primal.",["sourceHash"]="0ee4b4a6f30f217e1c5ba716e534cdd32b9399aee3afc58ae87236a8737aa84b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7861]={["aftermath"]="Primal judged the Vilebranch to have suffered a crippling blow.",["atomIDs"]={"7861:description:1-94","7861:description:99-203","7861:objective:1-85","7861:objective:87-173","7861:objective:178-271"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7861:completion:1-43","7861:completion:45-77"},["opening"]="Primal's notice targeted both Hexx and the elite guard around her. The high priestess and Aman'zasi force atop Jintha'Alor were treated as a single leadership threat.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront Hexx and twenty elite guards.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Primal's priestess-and-guard assignment.",["sourceHash"]="b831f4fd0eafd06a8ed3a92e216d7fe1b2dac55c9bf72d743955b71ad1d732fd",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7862]={["aftermath"]="Primal called the applicant worthy but said all applications would be reviewed the following year.",["atomIDs"]={"7862:description:1-102","7862:description:104-249","7862:description:254-287","7862:description:292-329","7862:description:334-371","7862:description:376-410","7862:objective:1-160","7862:objective:165-261"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7862:completion:1-59","7862:completion:61-130","7862:completion:132-178"},["opening"]="Malkhor's death left the captaincy vacant. The advertised application required action against four kinds of Vilebranch warrior before Primal would consider a candidate.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to fulfill the four-part guard application.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} submitted the completed assignment to Primal.",["sourceHash"]="026b6d7bccff982ef08a3fa534d67205f2fa77dbe58a7bf9829de86a1bfdc523",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7871]={["atomIDs"]={"7871:description:1-73","7871:description:75-190","7871:description:195-241","7871:description:243-278","7871:description:283-320","7871:description:323-375","7871:objective:1-135"},["opening"]="Ashenvale's trees supplied the machines advancing against it. At Silverwing Grove, Farsong called for aid beyond the tunnel, where defending the hold also meant contesting the Horde's cutting operations.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Farsong a mark from service in the gulch.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the requested Warsong mark at Silverwing Grove.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="2a9bb650e3f1af83dab96c81420e5d5d2468a4debf8e28b40ba0edd455479c85",["sourceRaceMask"]="1101",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7872]={["atomIDs"]={"7872:description:1-73","7872:description:75-190","7872:description:195-241","7872:description:243-278","7872:description:283-320","7872:description:323-375","7872:objective:1-135"},["opening"]="Silverwing Hold stood in the path of the Horde's work in the forest. Farsong offered recognition to those who went beyond the tunnel to oppose that advance.",["pending"]="{actor} would answer Farsong's call and return with a mark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the mark to Sentinel Farsong.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="0aa897724623a3f9fec9fa561379716051e7741e7ebdfc4d78b52f3b68f8051b",["sourceRaceMask"]="1101",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7873]={["atomIDs"]={"7873:description:1-73","7873:description:75-190","7873:description:195-241","7873:description:243-278","7873:description:283-320","7873:description:323-375","7873:objective:1-135"},["opening"]="Farsong spoke for the forest as well as its defenders. The evergreen stands falling to Horde machinery gave her call to Warsong Gulch its purpose, with a returned mark serving as proof.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to aid the defense and carry a mark back to Farsong.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} handed Farsong the mark requested for the defense.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="972b7b37a36d0aba5522a0b529f7110c602bbba6a490fc705b200b14747b8b0a",["sourceRaceMask"]="1101",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7874]={["atomIDs"]={"7874:description:1-77","7874:description:79-145","7874:description:147-176","7874:description:178-253","7874:description:258-351","7874:description:353-419","7874:description:422-481","7874:objective:1-144"},["opening"]="The captain at Mor'shan refused to recognize Silverwing authority over the timber. His promised recognition was tied to a mark earned in the struggle against their forces.",["pending"]="{actor} would return to Shatterskull with a Warsong mark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the mark to Shatterskull at Mor'shan.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="6ebda372313b416945eb948aee97f8f9c0d9e447defbc968e953a9cfcc7c50b8",["sourceRaceMask"]="690",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7875]={["atomIDs"]={"7875:description:1-77","7875:description:79-145","7875:description:147-176","7875:description:178-253","7875:description:258-351","7875:description:353-419","7875:description:422-481","7875:objective:1-144"},["opening"]="Shatterskull's claim to the forest left no place for the Sentinels' objections. He directed fighters into the gulch to force the Horde's progress onward.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring a mark back from the fighting for the Outriders.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the mark required by Captain Shatterskull.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="edfe1cb12259702189249920882d9ff6151ecc55b496f7251721eea50f3f4eba",["sourceRaceMask"]="690",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7876]={["atomIDs"]={"7876:description:1-77","7876:description:79-145","7876:description:147-176","7876:description:178-253","7876:description:258-351","7876:description:353-419","7876:description:422-481","7876:objective:1-144"},["opening"]="For Shatterskull, the fight concerned who could command Ashenvale's resources. Silverwing opposition was to be met by force, with marks carried home to show the Outriders' service.",["pending"]="{actor} would support the Outriders and report with a mark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the requested mark to Shatterskull.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="8766ac428bc49dab3b162b92d36a4f16f0e3b5f8f136e0b1dffc13bbc9a008b1",["sourceRaceMask"]="690",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7877]={["atomIDs"]={"7877:description:1-86","7877:description:88-122","7877:objective:1-65","7877:objective:67-84"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Find the Shen'dralar treasure beneath the Athenaeum's stairway.",["opening"]="The library held an ancient chest beneath its stairs. Permission to take a desired reward sent the visitor back to that concealed place within the Athenaeum.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek the ancient chest beneath the stairs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found and opened the Shen'dralar chest.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="71d9263f63277911716aa3144fb9ddbe383df4f8d86e635d0ea20164b96c3743",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[7886]={["atomIDs"]={"7886:description:1-59","7886:description:61-123","7886:description:125-174","7886:objective:1-107"},["opening"]="Service in the gulch could earn further Silverwing trust. The talisman offered a way to acknowledge that service without turning each ceremony into another account of the same battle.",["pending"]="{actor} would present the Silverwing talisman for recognition.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the talisman to receive the Silverwings' acknowledgment.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="3958e55febfa3e6234a18c2ea45d6ca100e8e6a4ada6f27242ac83e263b925c7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7887]={["atomIDs"]={"7887:description:1-59","7887:description:61-123","7887:description:125-174","7887:objective:1-107"},["opening"]="The Silverwings continued to ask for aid while offering recognition for the talismans already earned. Their request concerned sustained service to the defense of the forest.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the earned talisman before the Sentinels.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Silverwing talisman presentation.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="276eb55fa9b073b12f72302d809d5f99c8038dfe8c98d77bbef4be308be89dc0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7888]={["atomIDs"]={"7888:description:1-59","7888:description:61-123","7888:description:125-174","7888:objective:1-107"},["opening"]="A talisman carried the Silverwings' recognition of earlier effort. The same cause still called for support in the gulch, with trust offered for continued aid.",["pending"]="{actor} would present the Silverwing talisman.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} received acknowledgment for the presented talisman.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="7d50888d85b36ed5be0f0017ead61c0eea590a6265ac4e766b82c3c4a1381920",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7905]={["atomIDs"]={"7905:description:1-29","7905:description:32-112","7905:description:117-189","7905:description:192-261","7905:description:266-329","7905:description:332-346","7905:description:349-357","7905:objective:1-95"},["opening"]="Melnan advertised the Faire's arrival with a voucher for prize tickets. Gelvas inside the carnival was the person designated to redeem the offer.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimegate.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="21232eff654d87946d251ad7eb1f72718f9ea05334cc15f6dddef30345220ba0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7907]={["aftermath"]="The recipient welcomed the gesture as the beginning of a lasting tie with the Darkmoon and offered a greater card in appreciation.",["atomIDs"]={"7907:description:1-147","7907:description:151-381","7907:objective:1-66"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"7907:completion:1-42","7907:completion:44-157","7907:completion:159-258"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Return the assembled beasts deck to the Darkmoon Faire.",["opening"]="Completing the deck caused a ninth card to appear, directing its finder to return the collection to the Darkmoon Faire. The faire's traveling nature meant the invitation had to wait for its arrival rather than lead to a fixed destination.",["pending"]="{actor} would take the assembled deck to the Darkmoon Faire.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the beasts deck to the faire.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="abc2020cc11880a481444a041b941852caebf533f0a453ee5a9a579a1d8d1611",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[7921]={["atomIDs"]={"7921:description:1-59","7921:description:61-123","7921:description:125-174","7921:objective:1-107"},["opening"]="Recognition at Silverwing Grove belonged to service already rendered. A talisman could be brought forward while the Sentinels asked that the defense continue.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the talisman for the Silverwings' recognition.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the earned talisman to the Sentinels.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="aa0a33bcc221524e5917a7d9125049e5fedcf99b8039ee012f0c8bb32bc82ac2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7922]={["atomIDs"]={"7922:description:1-59","7922:description:61-110","7922:description:112-140","7922:objective:1-100"},["opening"]="The Outriders' call did not end with a first mark. They asked for continued pressure on the Silverwing Sentinels and further tokens of service.",["pending"]="{actor} would present the earned Warsong mark for recognition.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Warsong mark before the Outriders.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="cf6c96a8a75da6a84a35f932468ffe9d99a3a87aa66b6c1eb1cf16555878db53",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7923]={["atomIDs"]={"7923:description:1-59","7923:description:61-110","7923:description:112-140","7923:objective:1-100"},["opening"]="The Warsong mark had become a token of standing with the Outriders. Their next request was for the bearer to keep aiding the struggle against the Sentinels.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to present the mark to the Outriders.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Outriders' mark presentation.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="caa0869a7d7c118bc91036aafeed5f66af5b6c24bdff20c2c099c54c4d0956bd",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
