[8053]={["aftermath"]="Jin'rokh recognized a friend of the tribe and presented the freethinker's armguards as the tangible power attached to that standing.",["atomIDs"]={"8053:description:1-18","8053:description:21-55","8053:description:58-95","8053:description:98-133","8053:description:136-177","8053:description:180-225","8053:description:228-258","8053:description:261-310","8053:description:315-349","8053:description:352-367","8053:description:370-396","8053:description:399-431","8053:description:434-487","8053:objective:1-51","8053:objective:54-143","8053:objective:148-215"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8053:completion:1-24","8053:completion:27-77","8053:completion:80-109","8053:completion:114-132","8053:completion:135-171","8053:completion:174-210"},["opening"]="Jin'rokh gave outsiders a place among Zandalar freethinkers, valuing conviction even where beliefs differed. The first armor offering required Friendly standing and Primal Hakkari Bindings recovered from Zul'Gurub.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Primal Hakkari Bindings to Jin'rokh under the stated reputation requirement.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Jin'rokh's Primal Hakkari Bindings turn-in.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="a5ed48a41cbdf88841262d3c86a2d2cc5d6ee950c47f6dfc7110535384f51303",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8054]={["aftermath"]="The offered belt represented both honor among the tribe and its mojo. Jin'rokh linked the recognition to conviction against Hakkar's servants.",["atomIDs"]={"8054:description:1-38","8054:description:41-87","8054:description:90-135","8054:description:138-186","8054:description:189-235","8054:description:238-303","8054:description:306-334","8054:description:337-362","8054:description:367-409","8054:description:412-449","8054:description:452-484","8054:objective:1-50","8054:objective:53-141","8054:objective:146-213"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8054:completion:1-35","8054:completion:38-72","8054:completion:75-111","8054:completion:114-144","8054:completion:149-179","8054:completion:182-205","8054:completion:208-227","8054:completion:230-245"},["opening"]="The freethinkers' honor recalled an older persecution: opponents of Hakkar were branded heretics when the Gurubashi Empire was strong. Jin'rokh sought a Primal Hakkari Shawl, with Honored standing required for the belt he offered.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to supply a Primal Hakkari Shawl to Jin'rokh.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Primal Hakkari Shawl required by Jin'rokh's offering.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="636389991712179116f43e9cdedebc895f364f2e28bc58caae0c3d496ce8deac",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8055]={["aftermath"]="Jin'rokh regarded the offering as proof that an outsider's beliefs could earn reverence among the Zandalar. The breastplate marked that acceptance.",["atomIDs"]={"8055:description:1-41","8055:description:44-84","8055:description:87-103","8055:description:106-154","8055:description:157-233","8055:description:238-298","8055:description:301-316","8055:description:319-352","8055:description:355-409","8055:description:412-428","8055:description:431-481","8055:objective:1-51","8055:objective:54-142","8055:objective:147-214"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8055:completion:1-34","8055:completion:37-90","8055:completion:93-138","8055:completion:141-202","8055:completion:205-234","8055:completion:237-255","8055:completion:260-293","8055:completion:296-322"},["opening"]="The freethinker's breastplate joined steadfast belief to enduring armor. Jin'rokh reserved it for those revered by the tribe and demanded a Primal Hakkari Tabard from Zul'Gurub.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to obtain a Primal Hakkari Tabard for Jin'rokh.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled Jin'rokh's Primal Hakkari Tabard turn-in.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="96c54ed4eb9c4c09bac9e3ed69a9e9ec202c2d71ee1ddbabe59290f734ad5717",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
