[8181]={["aftermath"]="Yeh'kinya announced that Hakkar had already been reborn in Zul'Gurub. He credited the earlier assistance with hastening that return, exposing the betrayal Ironboot had feared.",["atomIDs"]={"8181:description:1-57","8181:description:60-163","8181:description:166-237","8181:description:240-268","8181:description:273-316","8181:description:319-371","8181:objective:1-21"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8181:completion:1-106","8181:completion:109-135","8181:completion:140-149","8181:completion:152-185","8181:completion:188-241","8181:completion:243-289","8181:completion:292-303","8181:completion:306-342","8181:completion:347-360","8181:completion:363-410"},["opening"]="Ironboot's reading of the Mosh'aru tablets overturned Yeh'kinya's explanation of the egg. He believed it would recreate Hakkar rather than contain him and urged that the troll be confronted before the god returned.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront Yeh'kinya about the egg.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Yeh'kinya after Ironboot's warning.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="7df296cab5525fe01bba308bb1e277e5d57a3984b97c1eba9e0793e89a74ab10",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8182]={["aftermath"]="Molthor believed the Zandalar might know a way to defeat Hakkar. He directed further preparation among the island's people for a task he expected to be bloody.",["atomIDs"]={"8182:description:1-30","8182:description:33-147","8182:description:150-230","8182:description:235-321","8182:description:324-420","8182:description:423-495","8182:objective:1-36"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8182:completion:1-42","8182:completion:45-172","8182:completion:177-299"},["opening"]="Ironboot feared Hakkar's new reign could spread across Azeroth. He turned toward the Zandalar on Yojamba Isle, hoping their leader Molthor could explain how the Soulflayer might be defeated.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to consult Molthor on Yojamba Isle.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Molthor in Stranglethorn.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="ce76b4cea7eb5473b40fa35ecf7cdc049bc52f47a49fe10101c76485b9b80a9e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8183]={["aftermath"]="Molthor accepted the heart as evidence that the Soulflayer was slain. His declaration of the world's safety expressed the importance he placed on that defeat.",["atomIDs"]={"8183:description:1-38","8183:description:41-134","8183:objective:1-53"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8183:completion:1-24","8183:completion:27-59","8183:completion:62-80","8183:completion:85-128","8183:completion:131-165"},["opening"]="Hakkar's heart still burned with a remnant of the defeated Soulflayer's power. The cursed organ needed to be taken to Molthor on Yojamba Isle.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the Heart of Hakkar to Molthor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Heart of Hakkar to Molthor.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="66efd39635907f25a67efc7bd7697aafb36c13e156a5740fcf3d3e54dc7be1cd",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8184]={["atomIDs"]={"8184:description:1-74","8184:description:78-207","8184:description:210-247","8184:description:249-302","8184:description:307-322","8184:description:324-353","8184:description:355-425","8184:objective:1-71","8184:objective:75-93","8184:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8184:completion:1-16","8184:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="Zanza offers the ancient enchantment called Presence of Might. Its preparation requires a Primal Hakkari Idol from the strongest lieutenants and a punctured doll from the temple's refuse.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply the idol and doll to Zanza.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the materials exchange for Presence of Might.",["sourceHash"]="6031340b6853212a1faf4b6e570844f0733542d547eea62c6de3b1c665c461dd",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8185]={["atomIDs"]={"8185:description:1-74","8185:description:76-205","8185:description:210-247","8185:description:249-318","8185:description:320-349","8185:description:354-424","8185:objective:1-71","8185:objective:75-93","8185:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8185:completion:1-16","8185:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="The Syncretist's Sigil belongs to Zanza's restored troll enchantments. The spirit names an idol taken from Jin'do or the Bloodlord and a doll hidden among jinxed hoodoo as its components.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Zanza the two enchantment components.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the component offering for the Syncretist's Sigil.",["sourceHash"]="35952b16d06f9da970e9c105726a5351ca1e49ff491b4eb13054294221514e08",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8186]={["atomIDs"]={"8186:description:1-74","8186:description:76-205","8186:description:210-247","8186:description:249-318","8186:description:320-349","8186:description:354-424","8186:objective:1-71","8186:objective:75-93","8186:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8186:completion:1-16","8186:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="For Death's Embrace, Zanza again requires sacred power taken from the Hakkari rather than offered freely. A lieutenant's idol and punctured voodoo doll make the proposed enchantment possible.",["pending"]="{actor} would deliver the idol and doll for Death's Embrace.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed that enchantment's material commission.",["sourceHash"]="9496ca0f7a9e8c61630e7482b647dd36e1e74e316b1370fdbbed4ffae4d7f604",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8187]={["atomIDs"]={"8187:description:1-74","8187:description:76-205","8187:description:210-247","8187:description:249-318","8187:description:320-349","8187:description:354-424","8187:objective:1-71","8187:objective:75-93","8187:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8187:completion:1-16","8187:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="Falcon's Call can be created through Zanza's knowledge of old troll magic. The ingredients are a Primal Hakkari Idol and a doll found among the jinxed piles inside the ruins.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply Falcon's Call's required components.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Zanza the components for Falcon's Call.",["sourceHash"]="eb4968140750af35b76d75f846981c3597353227a7674f00abc6e5c0bdd91a94",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8188]={["atomIDs"]={"8188:description:1-74","8188:description:76-205","8188:description:210-247","8188:description:249-318","8188:description:320-349","8188:description:354-424","8188:objective:1-71","8188:objective:75-93","8188:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8188:completion:1-16","8188:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="Zanza's offer of the Vigilant Embrace rests on the same recovered ritual materials: a powerful Hakkari idol and a punctured doll. Obtaining them reaches from the lieutenants to the refuse they leave behind.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the idol and doll to Zanza.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the component exchange for the Vigilant Embrace.",["sourceHash"]="3335a723fe5b5957f3ecae7218d94987ad88882be9fb69a7203007eebd3e865f",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8189]={["atomIDs"]={"8189:description:1-74","8189:description:76-205","8189:description:210-247","8189:description:249-318","8189:description:320-349","8189:description:354-424","8189:objective:1-71","8189:objective:75-93","8189:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8189:completion:1-16","8189:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="Presence of Sight is another of the ancient enchantments Zanza can restore. He directs the seeker toward the Hakkari lieutenants for an idol and jinxed hoodoo for a suitable doll.",["pending"]="{actor} would obtain both components for Presence of Sight.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Zanza with the enchantment's materials.",["sourceHash"]="ca40ab62ac563121fbcb96dc3879385bddc7bb492ac31a5de85face40e9e2068",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8190]={["atomIDs"]={"8190:description:1-74","8190:description:76-205","8190:description:210-247","8190:description:249-318","8190:description:320-349","8190:description:354-424","8190:objective:1-71","8190:objective:75-93","8190:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8190:completion:1-16","8190:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="The Hoodoo Hex offer requires tangible pieces of the Hakkari's own ritual world. Zanza asks for the idol and doll before he can make the old enchantment work again.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Zanza the Primal Idol and punctured doll.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the materials required for Hoodoo Hex.",["sourceHash"]="76a662f1dbdb09b7a06fefc0438b1b2c879e7a88f685381f51da5f443a7e4072",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8191]={["atomIDs"]={"8191:description:1-74","8191:description:76-205","8191:description:210-247","8191:description:249-318","8191:description:320-349","8191:description:354-424","8191:objective:1-71","8191:objective:75-93","8191:objective:96-116"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8191:completion:1-16","8191:completion:18-43"},["opening"]="A Prophetic Aura can be made through Zanza's ancient craft once its components are recovered. The search joins an idol from the powerful lieutenants with a doll from the hoodoo heaps.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply the two components for Prophetic Aura.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Zanza's Prophetic Aura commission.",["sourceHash"]="3dcf044de53b98839765ff1c66f9c394168ecd6be060309ff741f88d56437f06",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
