[8301]={["aftermath"]="Baristolth granted the ability to deputize helpers, without assuming any had yet been chosen.",["atomIDs"]={"8301:description:1-68","8301:description:70-205","8301:description:210-304","8301:description:306-382","8301:description:384-460","8301:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8301:completion:1-24","8301:completion:26-103","8301:completion:105-200"},["opening"]="The Bronze brood distrusted mortal races despite the potential Baristolth saw. Carapace fragments from the three active hives would demonstrate service against the common threat.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect two hundred fragments.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the carapace collection.",["sourceHash"]="caef740e2583cf9b59484adef9700830bc950be5644eeb339f9e17eebee0102e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8302]={["aftermath"]="Another deputy could now be appointed.",["atomIDs"]={"8302:description:1-36","8302:description:38-126","8302:description:131-187","8302:description:189-202","8302:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8302:completion:1-16","8302:completion:18-91"},["opening"]="Further fragments would support another deputy's authorization. Baristolth emphasized choosing helpers wisely rather than treating their assistance as automatic.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return with two hundred more fragments.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the further collection.",["sourceHash"]="d5ce850e92000a74db1aa0d935d55253e8e351faa240ab2135f44942f061b3d3",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8303]={["atomIDs"]={"8303:description:1-15","8303:description:20-66","8303:description:68-109","8303:description:111-148","8303:description:150-206","8303:objective:1-54"},["opening"]="Baristolth acknowledged how much he had withheld amid hidden enemies. A tome and a visit to the master would move the service beyond the Watcher's guarded instructions.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to seek Anachronos with the offered knowledge.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Anachronos.",["sourceHash"]="7170cc6fd9b5034d70431d6f7eb61ffa9509dd92d26b4ef89479cb2e74932629",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8304]={["aftermath"]="Mar'alith resolved that she must be found whether alive or dead, but remained bound to the outpost.",["atomIDs"]={"8304:description:1-33","8304:description:38-124","8304:description:126-210","8304:description:212-304","8304:description:309-369","8304:description:374-409","8304:description:411-476","8304:objective:1-115","8304:objective:117-178","8304:objective:183-262"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8304:completion:1-55","8304:completion:60-113","8304:completion:115-132","8304:completion:134-174","8304:completion:176-206"},["opening"]="Natalia's disappearance followed weeks of private muttering and insistence on continuing her research. Mar'alith could not spare soldiers or leave his command, so the last sighting at the dwarven camp became an inquiry for another traveler.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to question the camp about Natalia.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the requested findings.",["sourceHash"]="b3f57527f59dc120650fcb0d825a7ef8c8d676caf21de431e4f8afa7f65d1179",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8305]={["atomIDs"]={"8305:description:1-94","8305:description:96-195","8305:description:197-260","8305:objective:1-65"},["opening"]="A single crystalline tear near the barrier memorialized the losses of the earlier war. Anachronos directed contemplation there as the means to understand what those sands remembered.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gaze into the memorial tear.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found and examined the crystal.",["sourceHash"]="642d04a3c79d0d009ddb64cb4ed7c751397df699ebca0892ce2b28146ea80a2e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8306]={["aftermath"]="The report of C'Thun left him asking what the power was and how it had transformed Natalia.",["atomIDs"]={"8306:description:1-85","8306:description:87-120","8306:description:122-227","8306:description:229-321","8306:description:326-370","8306:description:372-388","8306:description:393-434","8306:objective:1-87","8306:objective:89-223","8306:objective:228-315","8306:objective:317-372","8306:objective:377-437"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8306:completion:1-44","8306:completion:49-55","8306:completion:57-88","8306:completion:90-104","8306:completion:106-191"},["opening"]="The camp's account pointed toward Natalia in the southern hive. Mar'alith asked for another visit to the dwarves for advice and authorized necessity if her reported madness proved true.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to discover Natalia's fate in Hive'Regal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the findings to Mar'alith.",["sourceHash"]="f2f16b543921e920ce169fc8439c96a7f7b04ddebccd09695578cd68b7bb086c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}
